+## Routes
+
+All routes are listed under Routes in `README.md`.
+
+`POST /import/sales` accepts `{ "csv": "..." }` with the header
+`ticket,soldAt,dishId,qty`. It returns imported ticket and dish quantity counts.
+Previously imported tickets are skipped; a file is committed only if all rows succeed.
+
+`GET /reports/variance?from=YYYY-MM-DD&to=YYYY-MM-DD` returns an array
+of `{ itemId, theoretical, actual, difference }` for inclusive UTC days.
+Difference is actual minus theoretical; quantities use the item unit.
